# Testing & Coverage
# NOTE: CI-generated coverage.xml/junit.xml already live under build/
# (ignored above) -- do NOT add bare `coverage.xml`/`junit.xml` patterns
# here, they also match (and silently exclude from version control)
# legitimate checked-in fixtures like tests/fixtures/junit.xml.
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

